                      The Sorcerer's Promise           By: subhaan
-----------------------------------------------------------

Young sorcerer Akira could absorb negative emotions from others, but every burden made him weaker.
When a cursed spirit attacked his city, Akira was already exhausted from helping people.
His friends offered to share the burden. Together they faced the spirit, combining their strengths.
The curse vanished, and Akira learned an important lesson: carrying the world's pain alone is impossible.
True power comes from trust.
